{"unit_id":"Yihong89__dsh-voice-core#card-zh","repo":"Yihong89/dsh-voice-core","commit":"104691a1e632339d156deb02b41060f46b44a5a4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-voice-core 是供 DSH companion 插件组合的共享语音引擎，为 Web 客户端提供语音合成和播放。消费插件调用 applyVoice 注册 TTS 代理、speak 与 cheer 工具、命令、会话投影及可选的每日问候调度；createVoiceClient 可自动朗读回复、排队播放音频，并在切换会话时停止旧播放。它支持语音风格、手动朗读和定时问候，适合为 DSH 教学或陪伴 preset 增加语音交互。此库不含独立界面；默认把文本发往本机 127.0.0.1:3091 的 Qwen3-TTS 服务，无需 API key，需由消费插件组合 Host 与 Web 端。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:273-310","index.js:312-412","index.js:415-579","lib/client.js:480-543","lib/client.js:703-733"]}
{"unit_id":"Yihong89__dsh-voice-core#card-en","repo":"Yihong89/dsh-voice-core","commit":"104691a1e632339d156deb02b41060f46b44a5a4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-voice-core is a shared voice library for DSH companion plugins. It adds TTS routes, speak and cheer tools, commands, scheduled greetings, and a Web client that reads replies aloud and queues audio. Consumers provide host and client setup. It uses local Qwen3-TTS by default; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:273-310","index.js:312-412","index.js:415-579","lib/client.js:480-543","lib/client.js:703-733"]}
