{"unit_id":"Yihong89__dsh-voice-core#feature-1","repo":"Yihong89/dsh-voice-core","commit":"104691a1e632339d156deb02b41060f46b44a5a4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-voice-core 的功能「自动朗读回复」：客户端检测当前会话最新的 assistant 回复，延迟一秒后请求语音播放，并用会话游标避免重读旧消息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:480-543"]}
