{"unit_id":"Yihong89__dsh-voice-core#caveat-1","repo":"Yihong89/dsh-voice-core","commit":"104691a1e632339d156deb02b41060f46b44a5a4","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-voice-core 使用前须知：朗读文本和音色指令会经由 Host 代理发送至配置的 TTS 服务，默认地址为本机 127.0.0.1:3091；需先由消费插件组合语音引擎。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:329-332","index.js:373-376","index.js:253","index.js:273-276"]}
